# Bytecode caches. Python regenerates these on import, so a committed set goes
# stale the moment anyone RUNS the tool — every checkout then shows a page of
# modified .pyc it never touched, and `bdtools update` refused to move the
# checkout at all ("has local source changes: .../__init__.cpython-310.pyc")
# until the suite was taught to tolerate them in 2026-09. vsnp_gui hit the same
# thing at v0.4.73; this is that fix, applied here.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
